<title>NEW ZEALAND: Caltex NZ drops wholesale petrol, diesel prices.</title>
<headline>Caltex NZ drops wholesale petrol, diesel prices.</headline>
<dateline>WELLINGTON 1997-03-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>Caltex New Zealand Ltd said on Thursday it had dropped its wholesale price per litre for both grades of petrol by 1.0 NZ cent, and diesel by 2.0 cents (both inclusive of GST).</p>
<p>The new prices are effective from midnight.</p>
<p>Caltex said its move was in response to moves announced overnight by BP and Mobil.</p>
<p>--Wellington Newsroom (64 4) 4734746</p>
</text>
